\"Data were analyzed for cases reported during 1992--2000 using case reports updated by April 17, 2001.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"those for 2000 were based on an extrapolation from the March 2000 Current Population Survey\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Multidrug-resistant (MDR) TB was defined as resistance to at least isoniazid and rifampin.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Completeness of reporting to the national system is estimated to be >95%\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}